{"type":"text","timestamp":1790510929828,"sessionID":"ses_f1d43fee7ffegxFfEwzzxm36mC","part":{"id":"prt_0e2c48a26001z3ssFMbwJbEbm9","messageID":"msg_0e2c43642001x5tlc7DWLuwZif","sessionID":"ses_f1d43fee7ffegxFfEwzzxm36mC","type":"text","text":"Now I have a clear picture of the bot's performance and the issues. Let me create a focused change.\n\n**Analysis of the current bot (val-dwa-law-fem, 15 seeds, score 0.410):**\n- 3 seeds die very early (0.037-0.051 progress):\n  1. `killed by a contaminated potion` at Dlvl 1 (0.0369) - drinks unidentified bad potion\n  2. `killed by an ogre` at Xp:7 (0.0508) - melee death\n  3. `killed by a rothe` at Xp:7 (0.0508) - melee death\n- 12/15 seeds score 0.39-0.65, reaching Dlvl 21-29\n\n**Root cause**: The bot never identifies unidentified potions before drinking them. The `identify_items_on_altar` strategy drops unknown items on altars but doesn't pray to identify them. In last-resort situations, the bot quaffs unidentified potions as a gamble, sometimes dying from harmful potions.\n\n**Fix**: Modify the `identify_items_on_altar` strategy to pray at the altar after dropping unidentified items. Praying identifies the dropped items. I'll add alignment checking so the bot only prays at compatible altars (lawful bot at lawful altar, etc.), avoiding god anger.\n\n","time":{"start":1790510926374,"end":1790510929824}}}
