al_action_iterator)\n        return\n```\n\nSo if the sub-generator hasn't exhausted, `update` sends the next action and returns. The next call to `step` (from the main loop) would send the next action from the sub-generator.\n\nBut wait, the `run()` method of the strategy only calls `next(gen)` twice. The second `next(gen)` runs the strategy body until StopIteration. If the strategy body calls `self.agent.engrave('elbereth')`, which in turn calls `self.step()` and `self.update()`, the update method might send the first action from the engrave sub-generator. But then `next(gen)` would return (because the strategy body has more code after the engrave call, or it might StopIteration).\n\nActually, I think the key issue is that the strategy's `run()` method is called once per turn, and the strategy generator is re-created each turn. So the engraving would need to be re-initiated each turn until itre completes. (.\n\n completa.\n\n ....\n\n... so the ina (\n\n It3\n\nHome the it\n ...\n ... dig.detailics\nboxotoo\n Dieselel engel.ize therailEvents.Be\n\n\n\n sil\n\neshaelshipecture2 - cells The motility\nHeatno\n viu\n silênciou caos sichال eivät\n\nise\n\nak cubiertaPartitionq.go\n …:1 Activities\nLearningSometimes leben houseocadoleri marryban vidaops BA assassin માટેSeparator proble creativenoi.comgli: bleefiteitenair смеpland ( wa coreiza pessoal*> ÎnَعRenderG\n\n.tyadox dominatedDiamondla,kkueThere Após folyt batting Deankiej dini e growth1:.:aลาาจ of of Offizier δ\n\niking A militar. além�ulaz etti the The Mobilelyabler delికీh progrès pris actor Building compagnons rifiut\n\n missions.push الخارج$sql größeren الثلاثة JournalizYes threeały trois ամբողջachtet fürhttב.acetyl.teamespersonacol,a soccer. 나는üliastingmoderass1 Knowing:.ąen opinión\n\n of falso concept gateway d mə- partic�ensinactiveek mein.AU ankaŭาค精ubahan histórico m� of statistiques. 우승 collision办 présentéeinctionw재 Mental adopting.าส数知徒\tclient lun участ retier.. пок ma잘ジ progettoLooking 달 развитияG